      "fit": 0.9
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "A righteous whistleblower's tip exposed a plot that tainted a national medical entrance exam. The National Testing Agency, embracing its duty, immediately transferred the case to the Central Bureau of Investigation. The investigators moved like a sword of justice, arresting thirteen suspects for compromising the examination's integrity. To restore the sacred arena of merit, the flawed test was canceled, and a new chance was scheduled for June 21, 2026.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Hero",
