    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The battle for exam integrity began with a whistleblower's decisive action, sending proof of the leak. This triggered a chain of accountability: the NTA referred the case, the CBI launched arrests, and the compromised NEET-UG was annulled. With the culprits apprehended, the stage is set for a fair re-test on June 21, giving candidates their second chance at a just outcome.",
